<view class="page"><view class="intro">把零散内容整理成一份好读的文档</view><view class="primary-button create" bindtap="create">＋ 新建文档</view><view wx:if="{{drafts.length}}" class="section-title">最近编辑</view><view wx:if="{{drafts.length}}" class="list"><view wx:for="{{drafts}}" wx:key="id" class="draft" bindtap="open" data-id="{{item.id}}"><view class="draft-main"><view class="draft-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="draft-meta">{{item.templateId === 'lab-report' ? '实验报告' : item.templateId === 'study-note' ? '学术笔记' : '课程作业'}} · 最近编辑</view></view><view class="state">{{item.status === 'exported' ? '已导出' : '未导出'}}</view><view class="delete" catchtap="remove" data-id="{{item.id}}">删除</view></view></view><view wx:else class="empty"><view class="empty-title">还没有文档</view><view>新建一份内容，稍后可以继续编辑。</view></view><view class="feedback-entry" bindtap="feedback">帮助与反馈 <text>›</text></view></view><bottom-nav active="home" />
